            "title": "FSAE Brake Pedal System",
            "summary": "Goals This brake pedal &amp; carriage design was inherited from GT's 2026 FSAE car, and my goal was to validate&hellip;",
            "content_html": "\n    <h2 id=\"goals\">\n      Goals\n    </h2>\n\n  <p>\n    This brake pedal &amp; carriage design was inherited from GT's 2026 FSAE car, and my goal was to validate the design under new load cases. I worked on analysis of brake pedal and carriage using SolidWorks and Ansys, and derived load cases for floor analysis.\n  </p>\n\n    <h2 id=\"load-cases\">\n      Load Cases\n    </h2>\n\n  <p>\n    FSAE rules require that the brake pedal system must withstand a force of 2000 N \"panic braking\" applied to the pedal. If one master cylinder fails mid-drive, the forces on the carriage increase, so this was also considered.\n  </p>\n\n    <h2 id=\"hand-calcs\">\n      Hand Calcs\n    </h2>\n\n  <p>\n    Pedal Statics:\n  </p>\n\n    <h2 id=\"fea\">\n      FEA\n    </h2>\n\n  <div  class=\"gallery-wrapper gallery-wrapper--full\">\n    <div class=\"gallery\" data-columns=\"3\">\n      <figure class=\"gallery__item\">\n      <a href=\"https://beckettrgordon.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/6/gallery/bconvergence-2.png\" data-size=\"472x354\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://beckettrgordon.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/6/gallery/bconvergence-2-thumbnail.png\" height=\"354\" width=\"472\" alt=\"\" >\n      </a>\n      <figcaption>Mesh Convergence Chart</figcaption>\n    </figure><figure class=\"gallery__item\">\n      <a href=\"https://beckettrgordon.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/6/gallery/b2.png\" data-size=\"1518x742\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://beckettrgordon.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/6/gallery/b2-thumbnail.png\" height=\"375\" width=\"768\" alt=\"\" >\n      </a>\n      <figcaption>Von Mises Stress</figcaption>\n    </figure><figure class=\"gallery__item\">\n      <a href=\"https://beckettrgordon.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/6/gallery/b3.png\" data-size=\"1518x742\">\n        <img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://beckettrgordon.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/6/gallery/b3-thumbnail.png\" height=\"375\" width=\"768\" alt=\"\" >\n      </a>\n      <figcaption>Deformation</figcaption>\n    </figure>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <p>\n    \n  </p>",
            "image": "https://beckettrgordon.github.io/portfolio/media/posts/6/Screenshot-2026-09-22-193227.png",
